    "picture_html": "<figure style=\"margin:1.6rem 0\">\n<img src=\"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/53/Lucknow_Skyline_From_Gomti_Nagar.jpg/960px-Lucknow_Skyline_From_Gomti_Nagar.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=imageinfo&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" alt=\"Skyline of Lucknow, the capital of Uttar Pradesh, seen from Gomti Nagar\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"width:100%;height:auto;border-radius:6px;display:block\"/>\n<figcaption class=\"gb-note\" style=\"margin-top:.4rem\">Lucknow, Uttar Pradesh's capital — the state whose GST collection fell 11% even as its GSDP and registered-taxpayer base kept growing. <a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Lucknow_Skyline_From_Gomti_Nagar.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Lucknow Skyline From Gomti Nagar.jpg</a>, Timestance, CC BY-SA 4.0, via Wikimedia Commons.</figcaption>\n</figure>"
